"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 45 of them. In 2025 that same pair ran 4% of normal on the middle, while April to May hit 138%. Every grid&rsquo;s driest year was 2011, at 24% to 33% of normal.</p>"}
